  "seed": "Option drag on a clip leaves a copy behind (task option-drag-on-a-clip-leaves-a-copy-behind). At Next defaults with no flag changed: open a recording, split it with Command K, hold Option over the second piece and the pointer wears the copy badge, then Option-drag that piece right with a real mouse. The original stays cut in two exactly where it was, a copy of the second piece lands later as a clip of its own reading the same recording, on a new track straight over V1 because V1 is busy there, and one undo takes the copy away.",
